    {
      "id": "text-wallet-detail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 625,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 80,
      "seed": 602,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 602,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Freighter Wallet Integration\n─────────────────────────\n• SEP-10 web authentication\n• HKDF-SHA256 key derivation from\n  1 wallet signature → 3 keys:\n  ├─ circuit secret\n  ├─ AES-GCM vault key\n  └─ X25519 keypair (sealed delivery)\n\n• snarkjs Groth16 proof gen (Web Worker)\n  └─ BN254 curve, 2-4s in browser\n\n• IndexedDB (AES-GCM encrypted vault)\n• Credential NEVER leaves this device\n• Origin-pinned postMessage to anchor",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Freighter Wallet Integration\n─────────────────────────\n• SEP-10 web authentication\n• HKDF-SHA256 key derivation from\n  1 wallet signature → 3 keys:\n  ├─ circuit secret\n  ├─ AES-GCM vault key\n  └─ X25519 keypair (sealed delivery)\n\n• snarkjs Groth16 proof gen (Web Worker)\n  └─ BN254 curve, 2-4s in browser\n\n• IndexedDB (AES-GCM encrypted vault)\n• Credential NEVER leaves this device\n• Origin-pinned postMessage to anchor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
