      "originalText": "NON-PII ONLY — every column is non-identifying:\n├─ sessions:    session_id, secret_hash, seal_pubkey, status\n├─ credentials: ciphertext (sealed to holder's key), commitment\n├─ revocations: revocation_nonce, reason\n└─ webhook_events: event_id (idempotency)\n\n⛔ Never stored: name, DOB, doc number, address, images",
