    {
      "id": "text-zk-detail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1465,
      "y": 498,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 80,
      "seed": 1502,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1502,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Groth16 BN254 pairing check (CAP-0074)\ng1_msm + g1_add + pairing_check\n\nverify_and_record() — 6 ordered checks:\n1. Issuer key is active & registered\n2. revocationRoot matches current root\n3. nowDays within 1 day of ledger time\n4. Nullifier not reused at this anchor\n5. Groth16 pairing check (expensive, last)\n6. Record nullifier + emit compliance event\n\nNullifier registry (per-anchor, Sybil-resistant)\nCompliance event = SHA-256 proof hash\n\n28.4M CPU instr | 0.00306 XLM | 10.9KB Wasm\nCAUQOEHFNJSX...UPSFTOZNMM",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Groth16 BN254 pairing check (CAP-0074)\ng1_msm + g1_add + pairing_check\n\nverify_and_record() — 6 ordered checks:\n1. Issuer key is active & registered\n2. revocationRoot matches current root\n3. nowDays within 1 day of ledger time\n4. Nullifier not reused at this anchor\n5. Groth16 pairing check (expensive, last)\n6. Record nullifier + emit compliance event\n\nNullifier registry (per-anchor, Sybil-resistant)\nCompliance event = SHA-256 proof hash\n\n28.4M CPU instr | 0.00306 XLM | 10.9KB Wasm\nCAUQOEHFNJSX...UPSFTOZNMM",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
