    {
      "id": "text-anchor-detail",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1465,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 80,
      "seed": 1602,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1602,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "@stellarproof/sdk integration\n• Rebuilds policy SERVER-SIDE (never trusts client)\n• Local pre-check (snarkjs, free, ms)\n  → On-chain verify_and_record (authoritative)\n• Receives proof, NEVER PII\n• Reads compliance events for audit trail\nDemo: \"Andes Remit\" (port 8790)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "@stellarproof/sdk integration\n• Rebuilds policy SERVER-SIDE (never trusts client)\n• Local pre-check (snarkjs, free, ms)\n  → On-chain verify_and_record (authoritative)\n• Receives proof, NEVER PII\n• Reads compliance events for audit trail\nDemo: \"Andes Remit\" (port 8790)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
