      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠ PII crosses exactly ONE edge:\nDidit → Issuer, in memory, once.\nEverything downstream is commitments,\nciphertext and proofs.",
